---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import port from '../assets/images/port.webp';
---

<section id="sucuraj" class="relative scroll-mt-20 overflow-hidden bg-sea-950">
  <div class="reveal relative min-h-[36rem] overflow-hidden md:min-h-[42rem]" x-intersect.once="$el.classList.add('is-visible')">
    <Image
      src={port}
      alt="Luka i riva u Sućurju, blizu Konobe Mizarola"
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
      style="scale: 1.04;"
      data-scroll-scale-image
      widths={[640, 960, 1360]}
      sizes="100vw"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-10 h-72 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#0d3b52_0%,rgba(13,59,82,0.96)_24%,rgba(13,59,82,0.68)_58%,rgba(13,59,82,0)_100%)] md:h-96"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-sea-950/92 via-sea-950/58 to-sea-950/12"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-sea-950/78 via-transparent to-sea-950/10"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 flex min-h-[36rem] items-end px-6 py-14 md:min-h-[42rem] md:px-14 md:py-20 lg:px-20">
      <div class="max-w-2xl text-white">
        <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-amber-100/90">Sućuraj harbour</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl font-normal leading-tight md:text-5xl" x-show="$store.lang.current === 'hr'">
          Na rivi, korak od brodova.
        </h2>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl font-normal leading-tight md:text-5xl" x-cloak x-show="$store.lang.current === 'en'">
          On the riva, steps from the boats.
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg leading-[1.6] tracking-[0.02em] text-gray-100" x-show="$store.lang.current === 'hr'">
          Sućuraj je ribarsko mjesto na istočnom vrhu Hvara, okrenuto prema kopnu i Pelješcu.
          Generacijama su se ovdje susretali brodovi, trajekti, ribari i putnici, a riva je ostala
          prirodno mjesto za sjesti, jesti i gledati luku.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg leading-[1.6] tracking-[0.02em] text-gray-100" x-cloak x-show="$store.lang.current === 'en'">
          Sućuraj is a fishing village on the eastern tip of Hvar, facing the mainland and Pelješac.
          For generations, boats, ferries, fishers and travellers have met here, leaving the riva as
          the natural place to sit, eat and watch the harbour.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
